unsupported :custody] (:yin.k/undecodable :custody-key)))\n\nTesting yin.vm.ucf.rows-test\ncounterexample-search random values 250 states: {:numbered 248, :refused 2, :max-work 395103} failures: 0\ncounterexample-search frame-bearing 40 states: {:numbered 37, :refused 3, :max-work 125296} failures: 0\ncounterexample-search with children 20 states: {:numbered 19, :refused 1, :max-work 308801} failures: 0\ncounterexample-search incidence families 100 states: {:numbered 74, :refused 26, :max-work 421748} failures: 0\n\nRan 64 tests containing 4062 assertions.\n1 failures, 0 errors.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01EbJ9W2XombkJMHZsqAhKk3","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"subcommandResults"}}]}
